:: Mightvale [Location sm-forest-town] {"position":"16800,6500"}
<<nobr>>
<<set $currentBiome = "forest">>
<<set $biomeBG = "forest">>
<<set $lastLocation = passage()>>
<</nobr>>
<div style="text-align: center;">
You are in the town of <<print passage()>>. What would you like to do?
</div>

[[Visit the Mightvale Mercenaries' Guild|MV Merc Guild]]
[[Visit the Blacksmith|Mightvale Blacksmith]]
[[Visit the Alehouse|Mightvale Alehouse]]
[[Leave Mightvale|Mightvale Travel]]


:: Mightvale Travel {"position":"16925,6500"}
<<nobr>>
<br><br>
<div style="text-align: center;">
Which direction would you like to travel in?
</div>
<</nobr>><div style="text-align: center;">
<<link "Travel East">>
    <<set $traveling to true>>
    <<set $travelTo = {
        destination: "Bavenmore",
        distance: 4, // Total distance
        energyCostPerUnit: 5, // Energy cost per unit...duh
        eventProbability: 0.5, // Probability of event per check
        eventInterval: 3, // Interval for event checks
        stopThreshold: 5, // Distance to trigger an intermediate stop
        campThreshold: 10 // Distance to trigger need to camp
    }>>
    <<goto TravelStart>>
<</link>>
</div>


<!-- Mightvale Mercenaries' Guild Passages -->
:: MV Merc Guild [nobr] {"position":"16700,6625"}
<<set $lastLocation = passage()>>
<br><br>
<<if $playerClass == "Swordsman">>
    You're greeted warmly as a fellow Swordsman. The guild is bustling with activity.<br><br>
    [[Talk to a guild member|MVMGuildMember]]<br>
    [[Talk to the Guildmaster|MVMGuildMaster]]<br>
    [[Check the notice board for work|NoticeBoard]]<br>
    [[Visit the guild shop|MVMGuildShop]]<br>
    [[Rest in the bunkhouse|GuildBunkhouse]]<br>
<<else>>
    You enter the guild curiously. Members seem busy, but you are welcomed to look around.<br><br>
    [[Talk to a guild member|MVMGuildMember]]<br>
    [[Talk to the Guildmaster|MVMGuildMaster]]<br>
<</if>>
[[Leave the guild|Mightvale]]


:: MVMGuildMember [nobr] {"position":"16500,6750"}
<br><br>
<<if $playerClass == "Swordsman">>
    Fellow guild members share insights about advanced combat techniques.<br><br>
<<else>>
    A friendly member notices your interest. "If you're looking to join, the Guildmaster can help you with that."<br><br>
<</if>>
[[Go back to the main hall|MV Merc Guild]]


:: MVMGuildMaster [nobr] {"position":"16600,6750"}
<br><br>
<<if $playerClass != "Swordsman">>
    <div style="text-align: center;">
    The Guildmaster, a figure of respect and authority, assesses you. <br>
    "What brings you to the Mightvale Mercenaries' Guild?"<br><br>
    </div>
    <<if $playerClass == "">>
        <<link "Ask about becoming a Swordsman">><<goto "SwordsmanInfo">><</link>><br>
    <</if>>
    [[Nothing, sorry to bother you.|MV Merc Guild]]
<<else>>
    <div style="text-align: center;">
    "Good day, <<print $playerName>>!", the Guildmaster greets you. "What can I do for you?"<br><br>
    </div>

    <<run questCheck("The Bandit Menace")>>
    <<include "BanditMenace_Dialog">><br>

    [[Nothing, thank you sir.|MV Merc Guild]]
<</if>>


:: SwordsmanInfo [nobr] {"position":"16600,6875"}
<br><br>
"Swordsmen are masters of melee combat," explains the Guildmaster. "They possess formidable strength and an unwavering defense. With a sword in hand, they are a force to be reckoned with on any battlefield. To join us is to embrace a life of discipline and courage. Will you take up the sword and join our brotherhood of steel?"
<br><br>
<<link "Enroll in Swordsman class">><<goto "EnrollSwordsman">><</link>><br>
[["I'm not sure yet."|MVMGuildMaster]]


