<<set $lastLocation = passage()>>
<br>
You arrive at the blacksmiths shop. A slew of weapons and armor are on display and the smell of metal and coal is in the air.
<br>
[[Talk to the blacksmith|MV Blacksmith]]
[[Buy Items]]
[[Sell Items]]
[[Leave the blacksmith|Mightvale]]


:: MV Blacksmith [gen-shop nobr] {"position":"16700,6750"}
